[2026-01-30T08:04:59.569Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QNH4cggJdK4RMypj28QiGD","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→Execute this requirement immediately without asking questions.\n     2→\n     3→## REQUIREMENT\n     4→\n     5→# Standardize tab indicator animation across themes\n     6→\n     7→## Metadata\n     8→- **Category**: ui\n     9→- **Effort**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n    10→- **Impact**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n    11→- **Scan Type**: manual\n    12→- **Generated**: 1/30/2026, 1:41:16 AM\n    13→\n    14→## Description\n    15→RadarSidebar uses PulsingDot + border for active state while SwissSidebar uses border-l-2. Create a unified TabIndicator component that uses motion.div with layoutId=\"tab-indicator\" for smooth sliding between tabs. Style as 3px rounded bar on left edge with theme-appropriate color.\n    16→\n    17→## Reasoning\n    18→The current inconsistency between themes creates cognitive dissonance. A sliding indicator with layoutId creates the \"magnetic\" tab switching animation users associate with premium apps. This single change elevates perceived quality significantly.\n    19→\n    20→## Context\n    21→\n    22→**Note**: This section provides supporting architectural documentation and is NOT a hard requirement. Use it as guidance to understand existing code structure and maintain consistency.\n    23→\n    24→### Context: Report Shell & Navigation\n    25→\n    26→**Description**: Main report container with themed sidebar, toolbar, and navigation. Provides the structural layout and controls for viewing research reports.\n    27→**Related Files**:\n    28→- `src/components/report/ReportShell.tsx`\n    29→- `src/components/report/ReportView.tsx`\n    30→- `src/components/report/ReportSidebar.tsx`\n    31→- `src/components/report/ThemedSidebar.tsx`\n    32→- `src/components/report/ReportToolbar.tsx`\n    33→- `src/components/report/index.tsx`\n    34→- `src/components/layout/ReportModal.tsx`\