known (N/A/3)\n- **Impact**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n- **Scan Type**: manual\n- **Generated**: 1/30/2026, 1:41:16 AM\n\n## Description\nRadarSidebar uses PulsingDot + border for active state while SwissSidebar uses border-l-2. Create a unified TabIndicator component that uses motion.div with layoutId=\"tab-indicator\" for smooth sliding between tabs. Style as 3px rounded bar on left edge with theme-appropriate color.\n\n## Reasoning\nThe current inconsistency between themes creates cognitive dissonance. A sliding indicator with layoutId creates the \"magnetic\" tab switching animation users associate with premium apps. This single change elevates perceived quality significantly.\n\n## Context\n\n**Note**: This section provides supporting architectural documentation and is NOT a hard requirement. Use it as guidance to understand existing code structure and maintain consistency.\n\n### Context: Report Shell & Navigation\n\n**Description**: Main report container with themed sidebar, toolbar, and navigation. Provides the structural layout and controls for viewing research reports.\n**Related Files**:\n- `src/components/report/ReportShell.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/ReportView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/ReportSidebar.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/ThemedSidebar.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/ReportToolbar.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/index.tsx`\n- `src/components/layout/ReportModal.tsx`\n\n**Post-Implementation**: After completing this requirement, evaluate if the context description or file paths need updates. Use the appropriate API/DB query to update the context if architectural changes were made.\n\n## Recommended Skills\n\n- **compact-ui-design**: Use `.claude/skills/compact-ui-design.md` for high-quality UI design references and patterns\n\n## Notes\n\nThis requirement was generated from an AI-evaluated project idea. No specific goal is associated with this idea.\n\n## AFTER IMPLEMENTATION\n\n1. Log your implementation using the `log_implementation` MCP tool with:\n   - requirementName: the requirement filename (without .md)\n   - title: 2-6 word summary\n   - overview: 1-2 paragraphs describing what was done\n\n2. Check for test scenario using `check_test_scenario` MCP tool\n   - If hasScenario is true, call `capture_screenshot` tool\n   - If hasScenario is false, skip screenshot\n\n3. Verify: `npx tsc --noEmit` (fix any type errors)\n\nBegin implementation now.","numLines":59,"startLine":1,"totalLines":59}}}
